{"id":"fa77c5c28538fe4e","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md","title":"Tree Property","display":"df-tree-prop — Tree Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tree-prop","aliases":["58-df-tree-prop"],"display":"df-tree-prop — Tree Property","depends_on":["[[58-df-tree]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[58-df-order-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tree-prop"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tree-prop</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tree-prop — Tree Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"58-df-order-type\">58-df-order-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,T,&lt;_{T}\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,T,&lt;_{T}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}\\)</span> (tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,A,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,A,R)\\)</span> (order-type predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"58-df-order-type\">58-df-order-type</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NodeHeight}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NodeHeight}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S\\)</span> (node-height and level predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-tree predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\\)</span> (cofinal-branch predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TP}\">\\(\\mathrm{TP}\\)</span> (tree-property predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}node\\text{-}height} \\vdash \\mathrm{NodeHeight}_S(\\alpha,t,T,&lt;_{T})\\leftrightarrow t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\bigl(\\alpha,\\{s\\in T:s&lt;_{T}t\\},{&lt;_{T}}\\cap\\{s\\in T:s&lt;_{T}t\\}^2\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}node\\text{-}height} \\vdash \\mathrm{NodeHeight}_S(\\alpha,t,T,&lt;_{T})\\leftrightarrow t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\bigl(\\alpha,\\{s\\in T:s&lt;_{T}t\\},{&lt;_{T}}\\cap\\{s\\in T:s&lt;_{T}t\\}^2\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(L,\\alpha,T,&lt;_{T})\\leftrightarrow L=\\{t\\in T:\\mathrm{NodeHeight}_S(\\alpha,t,T,&lt;_{T})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(L,\\alpha,T,&lt;_{T})\\leftrightarrow L=\\{t\\in T:\\mathrm{NodeHeight}_S(\\alpha,t,T,&lt;_{T})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}prop} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Tree}(T,&lt;_{T})\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{NodeHeight}_S(\\alpha,t,T,&lt;_{T})\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists L\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(L,\\alpha,T,&lt;_{T})\\land0&lt;|L|&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}prop} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Tree}(T,&lt;_{T})\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{NodeHeight}_S(\\alpha,t,T,&lt;_{T})\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists L\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(L,\\alpha,T,&lt;_{T})\\land0&lt;|L|&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}prop\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}branch} \\vdash \\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow b\\subseteq T\\land\\forall s,t\\in b\\;(s&lt;_{T}t\\lor s=t\\lor t&lt;_{T}s)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists t\\in b\\;\\mathrm{NodeHeight}_S(\\alpha,t,T,&lt;_{T})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}prop\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}branch} \\vdash \\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow b\\subseteq T\\land\\forall s,t\\in b\\;(s&lt;_{T}t\\lor s=t\\lor t&lt;_{T}s)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists t\\in b\\;\\mathrm{NodeHeight}_S(\\alpha,t,T,&lt;_{T})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{TP}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall T,&lt;_{T}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\to\\exists b\\subseteq T\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{TP}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall T,&lt;_{T}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\to\\exists b\\subseteq T\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The tree property fails at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_1\\)</span> in ZFC because Aronszajn trees exist; CH is irrelevant.</li>\n<li>At an inaccessible cardinal, the tree property is equivalent to weak compactness in the standard ZFC characterization, so inaccessibility alone does not imply it.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree]]"